sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant UI as WatchModeSettings (React)
    participant BR as preload (RecorderBridge)
    participant CO as recorder/index.ts (协调层)
    participant WS as WatchSourceManager (新增)
    participant CH as chokidar (源目录 watcher)
    participant EXT as ExternalTranscodeController (既有)
    participant ENG as ExternalTranscodeEngine (既有单例)
    participant UP as UploadManager (既有单例)
    participant API as 后端 /recording/*

    Note over UI,API: ① 启动监听
    UI->>BR: startWatchMode(roomId, authToken, folderPaths, options)
    BR->>CO: ipc 'recorder:startWatchMode'
    CO->>WS: start(folderPaths, options, roomId, authToken)
    WS->>CH: chokidar.watch(folderPaths, {ignoreInitial:true, awaitWriteFinish:2000ms})
    WS-->>BR: 返回 {error?}
    CO-->>BR: 返回结果
    BR-->>UI: 监听已启动

    Note over UI,API: ② 外部软件写入新回放 (启动后才出现 → 触发)
    CH->>WS: add(file.mp4)  (awaitWriteFinish 稳定后)
    WS->>WS: 扩展名过滤 + 内存Set + manifest.has? 否 → 入队
    WS->>BR: send 'recorder:watchMode:event' {type:'fileQueued'}
    BR->>UI: onWatchModeEvent → 队列行 queued
    WS->>WS: pump() 取队首, running=true

    Note over UI,API: ③ 复用模式B链路 (逐文件串行)
    WS->>EXT: startExternalVideoTranscode(roomId, authToken, file.mp4, onJobDone)
    EXT->>EXT: 建 temp/cowatch-ext/<uuid> 输出目录 (每任务唯一)
    EXT->>UP: initUploader({disableThrottle:true})
    EXT->>ENG: startExternalTranscode({inputPath, outputDir, ...})
    ENG->>ENG: spawn FFmpeg → 写 HLS 分段到输出目录
    WS->>BR: send 'recorder:watchMode:event' {type:'fileStarted'}
    BR->>UI: 队列行 → processing
    loop 每产出一片 _opt.ts
        ENG->>UP: onSegmentReady → enqueueUpload
        UP->>API: POST /recording/segment (video/MP2T)
        API-->>UP: 200 → segmentKeys.push + 删本地
        EXT->>BR: send 'recorder:transcodeExternal:progress' {phase,uploaded,estimated}
        BR->>UI: onProgress → 进度条/百分比
    end
    ENG-->>EXT: close(0) → onComplete
    EXT->>UP: waitForUploadQueue()
    EXT->>API: POST /recording/finish (segmentKeys)
    API-->>EXT: VIDEO_ADDED 广播 (房间视频列表更新)
    EXT->>EXT: cleanupUploader + fs.rm(输出目录)
    EXT->>WS: onJobDone(true)

    Note over UI,API: ④ 完成去重 + 自动下一个
    WS->>WS: manifest.add(file.mp4)  (成功才记 → 重启不重处理)
    WS->>BR: send 'recorder:watchMode:event' {type:'fileCompleted'}
    BR->>UI: 队列行 → completed
    WS->>WS: running=false; pump() → 处理下一文件 (若有)

    Note over UI,API: ⑤ 停止监听
    UI->>BR: stopWatchMode()
    BR->>CO: ipc 'recorder:stopWatchMode'
    CO->>WS: stop()
    WS->>CH: watcher.close()  (在途任务跑完, 未启动排队任务丢弃, 源文件留盘)
    WS-->>BR: 返回
    BR-->>UI: 监听已停止
